    "description": "Natural Geode Rock\nType:\nNatural Geode Rock\nCondition:\nFair - shows sign of wear\nApproximate Measurements (inches):\n3L x 3W x 2H\nAll of our items featured are DONATIONS and all sales are FINAL. All BIDS are placed by the buyer with the understanding that this is a donated item that may contain unseen faults by our staff and is ultimately SOLD AS-IS as all available information is presented. Items come strictly as pictured and should be assumed to be AS-IS with possible unseen defects. We are NOT experts in any field. SOLD AS IS. Due to inconsistencies in monitor display, colors shown may not be true to item's actual color. Please expect a slight color shift. Item may have wear and tear from usage.\nAny measurements provided are for use as a reference. Returns for measurement discrepancies will not be accepted.\nWe do our very best to describe and list items accurately. With that said, we are not experts in any one particular field.\nIf you have a question about an item, please ask prior to bidding.\nVIDEO GAMES:\nGame boxes checked for disc only, may not include book/manual. Discs may have scratching. Games have not been tested unless otherwise noted. Any codes may be missing, used or expired. Cases may have cracks/broken pieces. Guitar Hero/Rock Band Controllers are untested unless otherwise mentioned. Refunds for scratched disks may not be accepted. You are bidding with this in mind.\nTRADING CARDS:\nMay include empty sleeves. Cards are not sorted or graded. Cards may be bent/ripped/damaged. We cannot guarantee the cards listed belong in each respective box set. You are bidding with this in mind. Refund requests will not be accepted for damaged cards or for cards that belong in different box sets. Items have not been inspected individually. Pre-owned / Used, with some evidence of previous use/wear. Please refer to photos as part of the description and ask questions before buying/bidding if you have concerns about the condition. Sold As I